# Agent instructions

This project uses context-before-code.

1. Read `CLAUDE.md` end to end before any task.
2. Read `RESEARCH.md` and `TECHSPEC.md` before writing code.
3. Read `adrs/` before changing architecture.
4. Follow the current phase prompt. Do not skip ahead.
5. Do not start implementation until `CLAUDE.md` says the current phase is an
   implementation phase.
